ing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Cluster Network Operator configuration"},{"depth":3,"slug":"nw-operator-cr-cno-object_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Cluster Network Operator configuration object"},{"depth":3,"slug":"nw-operator-cr-defaultnetwork_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"defaultNetwork object configuration"},{"depth":3,"slug":"nw-operator-configuration-parameters-for-ovn-sdn_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Configuration for the OVN-Kubernetes network plugin"},{"depth":2,"slug":"installation-launching-installer_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Deploying the cluster"},{"depth":2,"slug":"cli-installing-cli-linux_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Installing the OpenShift CLI on Linux"},{"depth":2,"slug":"cli-installing-cli-windows_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Installing the OpenShift CLI on Windows"},{"depth":2,"slug":"cli-installing-cli-macos_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Installing the OpenShift CLI on macOS"},{"depth":2,"slug":"cli-logging-in-kubeadmin_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Logging in to the cluster by using the CLI"},{"depth":2,"slug":"cluster-telemetry_installing-ibm-cloud-customizations","text":"Telemetry access for OpenShift Container Platform"}];
